<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="1c46-42cf-5dfe-0061" name="Halo - Covenant" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="6f3b-423b-f7e2-caee" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5bcb-7e03-b1d4-6907" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="bbdf-a84d-ce9d-61cf"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="5b63-fcf2-340a-d0a3"/></constraints><modifiers><modifier type="add" field="category" value="75bc-0464-cbbc-4190"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="5bcb-7e03-b1d4-6907" childId="7a89-f6ea-6672-838c" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="016f-7aeb-610d-0158" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" targetId="a02c-b714-98ad-b8e8" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="9298-9aa1-7495-1638" name="Army" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="0b0c-e65a-398a-c549"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="10c1-db4b-9b51-c819"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6dd9-5f43-e681-c1ed"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0b0c-e65a-398a-c549" name="Army: Covenant" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="40a6-2d73-31a1-7fd5"/></constraints><rules><rule id="a432-c95f-cf35-7de2" name="Caste System" hidden="false"><description>When creating a Covenant army, you may select one bonus from the following list:

  * Commanding Presence: Covenant Infantry and Artillery units that are within 6&quot; of at least one Elite model and not within an Officer’s morale bubble gain a +1 Morale bonus.
  
  * Cannon Fodder: Your army gets a free basic Inexperienced Grunt squad unit.
  
  * Wall of Deflection: Friendly units with Shield Wall or Resilient provide hard cover instead of soft cover to other friendly units when the line of fire passes through them.
  
  * Fury Unleashed: Covenant Infantry units that fail their Assault order test when within 9&quot; of a Brute model may re-roll the failed order test.</description></rule><rule id="65ed-bf20-1a60-48c7" name="Zealotry" hidden="false"><description>Regular or Veteran Covenant units ignore the Morale penalty from 1 Pin when taking Advance order tests, if they are not benefiting from a friendly morale bonus bubble.</description></rule><rule id="f1b5-8707-4806-e1f3" name="Orbital Superiority" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when a friendly Covenant Forward Observer resolves an Artillery Barrage or Air Strike, you may roll two D6 instead of one on the Artillery Barrage Table or Air Strike Table and choose which result to apply.</description></rule><rule id="a4f7-44eb-7b3d-99d5" name="Faithful When Supervised" hidden="false"><description>Covenant Infantry and Artillery units with Shirkers lose that rule while they are positioned within the morale bubble of a friendly Covenant Officer. If they exit the bubble or the Officer is lost, they regain Shirkers until within range of another valid Officer. If a unit exits the Officer’s morale bubble as part of a Snap to Action activation, it cannot regain Shirkers until the Officer and all units activated through that Snap have completed their orders.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="2057-5531-d536-4200" name="Army: Swords of Sanghelios" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="aed8-8b0f-80cc-b3fe"/></constraints><rules><rule id="83fc-73dc-b6e2-247c" name="Sangheili Command" hidden="false"><description>Swords of Sanghelios Infantry and Artillery units that are within 6&quot; of at least one friendly Elite unit and are not within an Officer’s morale bubble gain a +1 Morale bonus.</description></rule><rule id="f920-013d-6afd-5ee5" name="Disciplined Under Fire" hidden="false"><description>Each time a Veteran Swords of Sanghelios unit would gain 2 or more Pin markers from HE or another source, reduce the number of Pin markers gained by 1.</description></rule><rule id="886e-9c2a-0005-6472" name="Rite of Challenge" hidden="false"><description>When an Elite Infantry unit that includes at least one model with a Melee Weapon is given a Run order to assault an enemy unit, it counts as having the Fieldcraft special rule for that action.</description></rule><rule id="b5a9-76be-34d9-28dc" name="War-Chants of Sanghelios" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, at the start of any Game Turn from Turn 2 onward, choose 1 different enemy unit on the battlefield for each Elite unit in your army list. Each chosen unit receives 1 Pin marker. Units embarked inside transports cannot be chosen.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="acea-4d4a-1450-b733" name="Caste System" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="ec1b-e483-cf37-d075"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="38c8-8dfb-f6bc-00e0"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="3751-54d1-1c82-a411"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ec1b-e483-cf37-d075" name="None" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="134d-04ce-5deb-db2d" name="Commanding Presence" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f865-c513-fd2e-6779"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="7a89-f6ea-6672-838c" name="Cannon Fodder" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="bc5a-4c4e-c7de-cc3a"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="60f2-969a-dbe0-4b25" name="Wall of Deflection" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="dd0e-ebd8-a79d-e53c"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="4338-ee1b-d22f-a5d2" name="Fury Unleashed" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="b6ee-b761-24d8-83e2"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="61e9-016e-1612-f54c" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="499f-bea9-ae78-69ca" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" typeId="4f99-c622-96b9-db14" typeName="Unit"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="61e9-016e-1612-f54c" childId="87a9-b0fe-6da8-a80d" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"/><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="3+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="61e9-016e-1612-f54c" childId="43fc-1725-4a93-14e5" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="5+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selec