"Infusion-Enriched Methane" hidden="false"><description>All Grunt Infantry and Artillery models within 6&quot; of this vehicle count as being within 6&quot; of a Medic. In addition, Grunt Infantry units that are issued an order while within 6&quot; of this vehicle count as having the Berserker special rule for the duration of that activation. All Infantry and Artillery units that are not Grunts and are issued an order while within 6&quot; of this vehicle count as having the Shirkers special rule for the duration of that activation.</description></rule><rule id="f636-37b3-c14b-bf67" name="Methane Keg Launcher" hidden="false"><description>Range 12–36&quot;, Indirect Fire. This weapon does not inflict damage. If the shot hits, place a 3&quot; diameter Methane Cloud marker centred on the target point. The marker follows the normal rules for Smoke. Units within 6&quot; are affected by Infusion-Enriched Methane exactly as if they were within 6&quot; of the Methane Wagon.</description></rule><rule id="affe-5ff0-66fb-6b98" name="Volatile Methane" hidden="false"><description>If this vehicle is destroyed as the result of a shooting attack or assault, every unit within 6&quot; of the vehicle suffers one HE (1&quot;) hit.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="af49-2063-dfd1-fa9a" name="Open-topped" hidden="false" targetId="9f53-15e2-e2eb-9ee8" type="rule"/><infoLink id="1f3f-3248-4f5e-450e" name="Slower" hidden="false" targetId="3475-b3f7-37bc-ef72" type="rule"/><infoLink id="e53c-b7cc-287a-f23e" name="Reinforced Front Armour" hidden="false" targetId="2fca-b3ac-350d-0d37" type="rule"/><infoLink id="be3f-cee9-4e83-a793" name="Indirect Fire" hidden="false" targetId="6578-de34-1b6e-619f" type="rule"/></infoLinks><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="62ff-8463-6ecb-1d98" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions><