Shots 1, Pen HE, Team, Fixed, Howitzer, HE (2&quot;).</description></rule><rule id="1e63-1c4b-2895-21da" name="Heavy Thrusters" hidden="false"><description>This vehicle only doubles its movement on roads when given a Run order.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="0e50-b807-bf7e-9663" name="Reinforced Front Armour" hidden="false" targetId="2fca-b3ac-350d-0d37" type="rule"/><infoLink id="da73-62e9-ef2a-2a00" name="Team" hidden="false" targetId="6f66-da7c-bbd4-6256" type="rule"/><infoLink id="1431-6a24-4052-299a" name="Fixed" hidden="false" targetId="b59b-2104-403e-f4a6" type="rule"/><infoLink id="a9e0-ab52-b86b-3f5f" name="HE" hidden="false" targetId="c659-80b2-bebe-eb79" type="rule"/><infoLink id="b60d-f3d0-b981-6507" name="AT Gun" hidden="false" targetId="c079-b951-5547-15db" type="rule"/></infoLinks><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="62ff-8463-6ecb-1d98" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="d7c9-26f8-66c3-c1d3" name="Armoured Cars &amp; Transports" hidden="false" targetId="9ad2-eb83-f25d-9853" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="d028-530e-c7ca-626b" name="Transport" hidden="false" targetId="38b8-d7c9-0d17-70cc" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="06e6-7737-35c8-c6d8" name="Veterancy" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="1be8-f6ad-c907-a20b"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="ad42-c1b8-d396-c967"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="2ec3-a31a-796f-5845"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="1be8-f6ad-c907-a20b" name="Regular" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="0d66-9397-6230-ca1c"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="135.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d42c-9877-1e83-422b" name="Veteran" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="7b1b-c896-a7f5-7972"/></constraints><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="162.0"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="f154-2d74-0125-a788" name="Prophet of Regret" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Requirements: Prophet of Regret requires at least 3 Covenant Infantry units. Prophet of Regret requires an Elite Platoon Commander. Prophet of Regret requires one Grunt Infantry unit. Prophet of Regret requires one Jackal Infantry unit.</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="3900-72a7-0d87-886b"/></constraints><rules><rule id="4317-bd0d-9c78-5e8c" name="Divine Mandate" hidden="false"><description>Twice per game, at the start of a turn, choose one friendly Covenant Platoon Commander. Until the end of that turn, that Officer counts as a Company Commander.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditionGroups><conditionGroup type="or"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="2057-5531-d536-4200" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></conditionGroup></conditionGroups></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="0559-31e3-8cda-ffa9" name="Army Leader" hidden="false" targetId="5f79-a9ac-d0a1-d88e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="5735-0abf-a5d2-a5d3" name="Leader: Prophet of Regret" hidden="false" targetId="ec40-5201-9b25-ead3" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="30.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="90b0-4da9-91cb-4c8f" name="Ripa 'Moramee" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Requirements: Ripa 'Moramee requires at least 4 Elite Infantry units. Ripa 'Moramee requires an Elite Platoon Commander. Ripa 'Moramee may not include Brute units.</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="2ed5-1a82-4f6d-a898"/></constraints><rules><rule id="72af-a0bc-ca15-61ca" name="No Time to Brace" hidden="false"><description>Enemy Infantry and Artillery units assaulted by friendly Elite Infantry units do not gain Defensive Position from rough ground or obstacles. Units inside buildings, bunkers, or fortifications still gain Defensive Position as normal.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditionGroups><conditionGroup type="or"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="2057-5531-d536-4200" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></conditionGroup></conditionGroups></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="db00-6d5a-3a30-0b53" name="Army Leader" hidden="false" targetId="5f79-a9ac-d0a1-d88e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="28d6-8074-835e-fc5b" name="Leader: Ripa 'Moramee" hidden="false" targetId="f406-0c1b-53bb-1623" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="35.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d853-5262-eafd-dc4d" name="Tartarus" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Requirements: Tartarus requires at least 4 Brute Infantry units. Tartarus requires a Brute Platoon Commander. Tartarus may not include Elite units.</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="7e5d-1139-635a-3a3c"/></constraints><rules><rule id="696a-93b7-900a-a1a7" name="Brutal Display" hidden="false"><description>When a friendly Brute Infantry unit wins in Close Quarters, after the regroup move, choose one enemy Infantry or Artillery unit within 6&quot; and line of sight of that Brute unit. The chosen enemy unit receives 1 Pin.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditionGroups><conditionGroup type="or"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="2057-5531-d536-4200" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></conditionGroup></conditionGroups></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="4c72-4877-0a52-a685" name="Army Leader" hidden="false" targetId="5f79-a9ac-d0a1-d88e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="fe4c-559d-369e-5a77" name="Leader: Tartarus" hidden="false" targetId="06a3-0d35-2275-9239" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="20.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="62ff-8463-6ecb-1d98" name="Yapyap the Destroyer" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Requirements: Yapyap the Destroyer requires the Cannon Fodder Caste System bonus. Yapyap the Destroyer requires at least 4 Grunt Infantry units. Yapyap the Destroyer requires a Grunt Company Commander. Yapyap the Destroyer requires one Grunt Infantry unit to include a Deacon. Yapyap the Destroyer requires all Infantry and Artillery units to be Grunt units or upgraded as Grunts. Invalid units: ?</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="42e0-86b8-9f47-e3a3"/></constraints><rules><rule id="f634-946d-bd38-a5a2" name="Strength in Numbers" hidden="false"><description>Grunt Infantry units may re-roll failed Order tests while they are within 6&quot; of another friendly Grunt Infantry unit that has 7 or more models.

In addition, an army led by Yapyap the Destroyer may include two additional Grunt Cannon Fodder Mob units beyond the normal limits (up to 2 per platoon, and 4 in total per army).

An army led by Yapyap the Destroyer may also include vehicles from the Banished army list.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditionGroups><conditionGroup type="or"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="2057-5531-d536-4200" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></conditionGroup></conditionGroups></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="2ba0-a00b-edb7-553d" name="Army Leader" hidden="false" targetId="5f79-a9ac-d0a1-d88e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="8933-3085-0477-a3b8" name="Leader: Yapyap the Destroyer" hidden="false" targetId="bec3-5244-428f-3b77" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="75.0"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="6da3-3d05-9f16-f1ff" name="Thel 'Vadam" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Requirements: Thel 'Vadam requires at least 3 Elite Infantry units. Thel 'Vadam requires an Elite Platoon Commander.</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="15b4-0365-f6c5-7c33"/></constraints><rules><rule id="5ab0-474b-c1af-cd6a" name="United by Honour" hidden="false"><description>Friendly Swords of Sanghelios Infantry and Artillery units may benefit from Sangheili Command while within 12&quot; of a friendly Elite Infantry model, instead of 6&quot;.

In addition, at the start of each turn, you can remove 1 Pin marker from one friendly Swords of Sanghelios Elite Infantry unit.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="2057-5531-d536-4200" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="283c-faa2-8d12-1557" name="Army Leader" hidden="false" targetId="5f79-a9ac-d0a1-d88e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="e715-08b5-382b-ed68" name="Leader: Thel 'Vadam" hidden="false" targetId="06e7-6736-eeae-21e4" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="25.0"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><sharedSelectionEntries><selectionEntry id="2aa2-aa8e-d37c-4722" name="Sacred Relic" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><comment>Armoury item. Flat 15 pts. Limit one per army. Needs a Veteran Elite squad with at least one model besides the Officer/NCO.</comment><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="2d8e-025c-94f0-47ab"/></constraints><infoLinks><infoLink id="6544-433a-0280-32d3" name="Sacred Relic" hidden="false" targetId="7a6e-828b-ee4f-4106" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="15.0"/></costs></selectionEntry></sharedSelectionEntries></catalogue>
